# VarioField Mosquitto ACL (example installed as /etc/mosquitto/variofield.acl)
#
# Lab default: one shared user "variofield" for app + Edge.
# Tighten later with separate users (app vs device) if needed.
#
# Topics: saj/pdm30/<edge_id>/{cmd,rsp,telemetry,status}

user variofield
topic readwrite saj/pdm30/#

# Optional pattern if you add a read-only telemetry user later:
# user telemetry
# topic read saj/pdm30/+/telemetry
# topic read saj/pdm30/+/status
# topic read saj/pdm30/+/rsp
